ric:activity-6ccb39ae507e a prov:Activity;
    prov:used ric:inst-jsk-full, ric:selector-a01798a94b8a, ric:selector-quote-15c127ae1831.
ric:selector-quote-15c127ae1831 a oa:TextQuoteSelector;
    oa:exact "김대중 총재는 그분들이 소개해서 만났어요. 제가 고대 총학생회장을 한 데다가 해외 주재원 출신이잖습니까.".
ric:activity-6ccb39ae507e prov:wasAssociatedWith ric:agent-claude-code__claude-fable-5_;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-08-15T22:13:35+09:00"^^xsd:dateTime.
ric:stmt-c80b9c629ae4 a rdf:Statement;
    rdf:subject ric:agent-jsk;
    rdf:predicate foaf:knows;
    rdf:object ric:agent-kdj;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy ric:activity-6ccb39ae507e.
ric:activity-8244091af36d a prov:Activity;
    prov:used ric:inst-jsk-full, ric:selector-d05cd1017788, ric:selector-quote-8dd5311c5b3d.
ric:selector-quote-8dd5311c5b3d a oa:TextQuoteSelector;
    oa:exact "또 김대중 대통령이 당선자 시절에 한광옥韓光玉 당시 부총재하고 저를 일산 자택으로 부른 일이 있었어요. 저희한테 노사정위원회를 만들라고 하셨어요.".
ric:activity-8244091af36d prov:wasAssociatedWith ric:agent-claude-code__claude-fable-5_;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-08-15T22:13:35+09:00"^^xsd:dateTime.
