ric:activity-92c2a00f4835 a prov:Activity;
    prov:used ric:inst-jsk-full, ric:selector-ea0d4fb307aa, ric:selector-quote-b6eac671145a.
ric:selector-quote-b6eac671145a a oa:TextQuoteSelector;
    oa:exact "제가 정치에 입문할 때 노무현 부총재가 제 편을 들어줬습니다. 그때 처음 정치권으로 영입이 되었잖아요.".
ric:activity-92c2a00f4835 prov:wasAssociatedWith ric:agent-claude-code__claude-fable-5_;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-08-15T22:13:35+09:00"^^xsd:dateTime.
