    rdf:subject ric:agent-jsk;
    rdf:predicate foaf:knows;
    rdf:object ric:person-jung-jin-ho;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy ric:activity-6347487b8c70.
ric:activity-258bcadad94a a prov:Activity;
    prov:used ric:inst-jsk-full, ric:selector-5fb21d6d4d3f, ric:selector-quote-24d430985986.
ric:selector-quote-24d430985986 a oa:TextQuoteSelector;
    oa:exact "행시나 사시에 합격했던 친구들이 있고요. 윤은기尹恩基라고 공무원연수원 원장을 하고 강사로 유명한 친구도 있지요.".
ric:activity-258bcadad94a prov:wasAssociatedWith ric:agent-claude-code__claude-fable-5_;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-08-15T22:13:35+09:00"^^xsd:dateTime.
